\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"191\" height=\"34\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2009. 10. 12.(월)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"138\" height=\"34\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;각 학과별 지정된 장소</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"137\" height=\"34\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"123\" height=\"23\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">시험결과 발표</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"191\" height=\"23\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"></span><span style=\"COLOR: #008080; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2009. 10. 26.(월)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"138\" height=\"23\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">원스톱서비스 조회</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"137\" height=\"23\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. 졸업종합시험 일반 계획</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 종합시험 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">해당 전공분야의 학식과 능력을 종합평가하기 위하여 종합시험을 실시한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 주관 : 각 학과 주임교수 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 응시자격&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⒧ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">대학원, 산업대학원, 교육대학원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 3학기 이상 등록하고 지도교수의 추천을 받은 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(2) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">교육대학원 무논문 석사과정 신청자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 5학기 이상 등록하고 지도교수의 추천을 받은 자&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(3) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">산업대학원 무논문 석사과정 신청자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 6학기 이상 등록하고 지도교수의 추천을 받은 자&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 시험과목 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⑴ 석사과정의 종합시험 과목은 주임교수가 지정하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">3과목 이상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⑵ 박사과정의 종합시험 과목은 주임교수가 지정하는</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 4과목 이상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⑶ 시험과목은 동일교수의 과목만으로 시행할 수 없으며, 석․박사과정 모두 문제출제 교수가</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;반드시 2명 이상이어야 함. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 졸업종합시험 응시과목은 학차에 따라 한 과목씩 따로 응시할 수 없으며, </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;석사 3과목 이상․박사 4과목 이상 해당과목을 일괄적으로 응시하여야 함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(단, 응시과목 중 불합격한 과목에 대해서는 한 과목 응시 가능함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 합격기준 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⒧ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">대학원, 산업대학원 및 교육대학원 논문 석사과정</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;과목당 100점 만점에 석사과정은 60점 이상, 박사과정은 70점 이상인 경우</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;합격으로 인정하며 과목별 합격도 인정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">⑵ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">산업 및 교육대학원의 무논문 석사과정 신청자 :</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;과목당 100점 만점에 70점 이상인 경우 합격으로 인정하며 과목별 합격도 인정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2009. 9</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">금오공과대학교 대학원(산업 및 교육대학원)장</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
